WEBVTT

1
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:13,270
Say I'm unlucky

2
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:14,670
Weared it in an hour

3
00:00:14,670 --> 00:00:15,790
Good luck

4
00:00:15,790 --> 00:00:17,390
This guy is also blind in one eye

5
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:19,300
Never mind

6
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:21,700
Lin Xiangyang wants the squirrel to be his classmate’s pet

7
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:24,900
Maybe the eye-blocking dragon looks more fierce Xiaohui

8
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,100
You are ugly

9
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,100
But in two days

10
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:29,220
You are the most expensive squirrel in the whole line

11
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:38,060
Eat a piece of candy to relieve anger

12
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:41,960
good guy

13
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:43,480
Quite brave

14
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:45,890
You two come here

15
00:00:45,890 --> 00:00:47,290
Teach me well, teach Xiaohui

16
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:49,090
Remember, don't get beaten to death
